### Response Parameters

{% include '_generic_v4_response.md.j2' %}

#### data

| Field | Type | Always Present | Description |
|-------|------|----------------|-------------|
| total | long | Yes | Total number of matched hosts before pagination |
| offset | int | Yes | Pagination offset used in this query, starting from 0 |
| length | int | Yes | Page size used in this query |
| data | array | Yes | Host list; empty array when there is no data |

##### data[] item

| Field | Type | Always Present | Description |
|-------|------|----------------|-------------|
| bk_host_id | long | Yes | Host ID |
| ip | string | No | Host IPv4 address |
| ipv6 | string | No | Host IPv6 address |
| bk_cloud_id | long | No | BK-Network area (cloud area) ID |
| bk_cloud_name | string | No | BK-Network area (cloud area) name |
| host_name | string | No | Host name |
| os_name | string | No | OS name |
| os_type | string | No | OS type identifier (synced from CMDB) |
| alive | int | Yes | Agent status. Possible values: `0` (abnormal), `1` (normal); this is the Agent status persisted by the Job platform and may not be real-time |
